# Architecture

Dependencies flow inward only: `app/` → `features/` → `server/services` → `server/repositories` → `server/db`. `lib/` imports nothing.

- Routes: parse URL, compose components, Suspense/error boundaries — no queries, no business logic.
- Every read/write passes through the DAL (`server/auth`) in later phases.
- Add queries in repositories, not pages.

Full layer table: `docs/03-system-architecture.md#the-dependency-rule`
